title Example Gantt - Complex Release Plan

project starts the 5th of january 2026
saturday are closed
sunday are closed
date format is yyyy-mm-dd

-- Discovery --
[Stakeholder Interviews] lasts 6 days
[Stakeholder Interviews] is colored in lightblue
[Requirements Doc] lasts 5 days
[Requirements Doc] starts at [Stakeholder Interviews]'s end

-- Design --
[Architecture] lasts 7 days
[Architecture] starts at [Requirements Doc]'s end
[UX Wireframes] lasts 8 days
[UX Wireframes] starts at [Requirements Doc]'s end
[Visual Design] lasts 5 days
[Visual Design] starts at [UX Wireframes]'s end

-- Backend --
[Data Model] lasts 4 days
[Data Model] starts at [Architecture]'s end
[API Implementation] lasts 12 days
[API Implementation] starts at [Data Model]'s end
[Migrations] lasts 3 days
[Migrations] starts 2 days after [Data Model]'s end

-- Frontend --
[Component Library] lasts 8 days
[Component Library] starts at [Visual Design]'s end
[Feature Pages] lasts 14 days
[Feature Pages] starts at [Component Library]'s end

-- QA & Release --
[Integration Testing] lasts 6 days
[Integration Testing] starts at [API Implementation]'s end
[Integration Testing] starts at [Feature Pages]'s end
[UAT] lasts 5 days
[UAT] starts at [Integration Testing]'s end
[Deploy] lasts 2 days
[Deploy] starts at [UAT]'s end

[Milestone: Requirements Signoff] happens at [Requirements Doc]'s end
[Milestone: Code Freeze] happens at [Feature Pages]'s end
[Milestone: Go-Live] happens at [Deploy]'s end

-- Today marker --
today is 2026-02-09

